  "description": "cmix v21 forced text-mode wrapper using mmap allocation, PAQ8 level 5, a 100 MB PPMD cap, PAQ8 minmaps, sparse-match divisor 8, RCM32 run-context maps, a thirtysecond-size PAQ rolling buffer, and FXCM cmC2 maps divided by 2. The binary and english.dic are gzip-compressed and counted toward program_size.",
